# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PCA and diversity-aware selected panel
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PCA on cross-environment mean BLUPs of the four core traits (139 genotypes);
# K-means (k = 10) on PC1/PC2 of the top 30 eligible genotypes; the best-ranked
# genotype in each cluster forms the diversity-aware panel.
